      "content": "\"letting the darkness take you\"... that's a really heavy way to put it. you're saying that maybe there's actually a sense of peace in just... stopping? that it's not even about being \"brave\" or \"weak,\" but just about the logic of it all? like, if the debt can't be repaid, the only thing left to do is to just stop being a part of the equation?",
